Z||000000||maryjane||07-04-2001||07:59 PM||||Man walks into his house after work, sits down in the living room, & yells to his wife "quick, gimme a beer before it starts". She brings a beer and goes back to cooking supper. A little later he says the same thing again. She brings a beer , gives  him a frown and returns to the kitchen.<BR>A while later he yells again for "a beer before it starts" His wife comes in and yells" Is that all you're going to do, sit in front of that TV and drink? You're such a drunken slob,"<BR>Husband looks up an says,<BR>"It's started."<P>------------------<BR>Man named Paul comes home from the doctor,tells his wife "honey I just found out I only have 18 hrs to live." they hug each other and have a good cry then he asks to make love one last time. She says "of course" and they make long passionate love.  A few hrs later he says he only has 12 hrs left and wants to do it again so of course she agrees. Later that night he again asks to make love w/his wife and they do, but this time she rolls over and goes to sleep afterward,  He hears the clock ticking away in his head and wakes his wife up and asks for sex again. She says,<BR>"Dang Paul, I have to get up in the morning,<BR>you don't"<BR>84 SE 2.5<BR>not slow not fast-just halfast<p>[This message has been edited by maryjane (edited 07-05-2001).]||||reg||1
